<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand vehicle registrations fall in February.</title>
<headline>New Zealand vehicle registrations fall in February.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand in February was 19,205, down from 20,272 in January and 19,559 in February 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Registrations of new and ex-overseas vehicles totalled 17,633 in February, versus 18,368 last month and 17,864 in February 1996. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
